	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non dubito, quin meas acceperis per civem transmissas <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinum</placeName> cum <persName>Polyaeno</persName>; si quid praeterea vis curatum, indica.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Credo etiam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te a <placeName ref="l558">Witenbergensibus</placeName> accepisse, qualis sit status in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> et praecipue <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quid agatur cum <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName>, qui adhuc constantes sunt in defensione <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>suae Bethuliae, quibus precor Christum defensorem urbium suarum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Caesarem reliquisse Augustam 22. octobris certissimum est.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">A <persName>Bavaro <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Monachi</persName> splendide acceptus ac cum summo gaudio acceptus <placeName ref="l232">Oenispontem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>petit; milites adhuc dissident et seditiosi sunt; capitanei aufugerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>abbatis pagis spoliarunt; nomen illius excidit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Grassantur in optimos quoque <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ob denegatum salarium.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Considera Satanę instabilitatem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Episcopus <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName> vocatus a Caesare ad concilium minis quibusd<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>am miser abiit paucis adiunctis, probe intelligens, quid moliatur Cae<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sar in isto conciliabulo.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Specimen tibi mitto, quidnam contra nostras <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ecclesias constituerint.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Digni sunt, quibus acerbo scripto respondeatur, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut sciant se contra scripturam sanctam hos articulos constituisse et contra pa<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tres ecclesiae sententias suas tulisse.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">O miserum genus hominum, qui nihil <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>aliud venantur quam propriam gloriam, non Christi Iesu, filii dei.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Zuͦ <placeName ref="l378">Paris</placeName> hat man ußgeschruwen mit einer busaunen, wer d<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>o <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>welle gulden stücke, syden gwandt, specerei kouffen, der sölle uff ein bestimpte <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>stundt kommen; man welle alles wolfeil verkouffen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sic rex rapinam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Caesaream, quam ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> abduxit, distrahere conatur, quo populus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>rapinam videat et simul gaudeat cum aulicis<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quid <placeName ref="l257">Constantię</placeName> agat capitaneus cum mercimoniis <placeName>Nerobur<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>gensibus</placeName>, melius nosti quam ego.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Bellum imminet gravissimum, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et <placeName ref="l850">Austriaci</placeName> isti ausum dabunt absque dubio devast[at]ionis multorum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>locorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Ago praeterea tibi gratias immensas pro libello misso, quem legi ac <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>relegi, et hoc solummodo dolet, quod brevitate sis usus in rebus tam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>maximis et sanctissimis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Precor regi animum spiritu sancto inflammatum, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ut legat libellum diligenter ac relegat etiam, imo pellegat, quo doctrina <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>vera patrum inhaereat et dein fructificet.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Plura alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Si quid domino <persName ref="p944">Mauro</persName>, legato regio mittere constituisti, poteris <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>id facere, et ego probe curabo per postam ad illum fere omni <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>die; ne hanc occasionem negligas, oro.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> 5. novembris 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem eherwürdigen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>herren meyster <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>lütpriester zum ho<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>hen münster zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zu<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>rich</placeName>, mynem gün<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>stigen lieben herren<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
